Firmalife Horizon — Horizon-native workshop mod (Firmalife-inspired food slice).

Inspired by Firmalife (MIT) as used beside TerraFirmaGreg-Modern.
Not affiliated with Firmalife or TFC authors. Clean reimplementation for Horizon.

Textures: vendored from Firmalife (MIT) via `tools/fetch_firmalife_textures.py`
from the TFG-Modern `Firmalife-*.jar`; attributed; not an official Firmalife build.
